# ============================================================
# STEP 5 — Poll execution status
#
# After submitting an execution request (steps 3, 4, 6, or 7)
# copy the returned `id` into @executionId below and send
# this request repeatedly until `status` is no longer PENDING
# or RUNNING.
#
# Possible statuses:
#   PENDING    — queued, not yet picked up by the worker
#   RUNNING    — worker is compiling/executing
#   COMPLETED  — all test cases finished; check individual verdicts
#   ERROR      — internal worker error
#
# Compatible with: VS Code REST Client, IntelliJ HTTP Client
# ============================================================

@baseUrl     = http://localhost:8080
@token       = <paste-token-here>
@executionId = <paste-execution-id-here>

### Get execution result
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/execution/check/{{executionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
